          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Our toddler clothing minimum is 300 pieces per style. This applies to all product types, fabric choices, and size ranges. Minimum can be split across sizes within a single colorway. Lower quantities available at higher per-piece cost for sampling and prototype development."
