      </div>
      <div class="section__text">
        <p>GOTS (Global Organic Textile Standard) is the leading worldwide processing standard for textiles made from organic fibers. Our GOTS certification ensures that toddler clothing labeled as organic meets strict requirements throughout the entire supply chain, from organic farming to finished garment production. This certification provides assurance to parents and brands that organic claims are verified and trustworthy.</p>
        
        <p>GOTS certification covers multiple critical aspects of organic textile production. Environmental criteria prohibit the use of toxic chemical pesticides, synthetic fertilizers, and genetically modified organisms in organic cotton farming. Processing criteria require that all chemicals used in dyeing, finishing, and manufacturing meet strict environmental and toxicological standards. Social criteria ensure fair labor practices, safe working conditions, and no child labor throughout the supply chain. This comprehensive approach makes GOTS the gold standard for organic textiles.</p>
        
        <p>For toddler clothing, GOTS certification is particularly valuable because it guarantees that garments touching children's skin are free from harmful chemical residues. The standard prohibits formaldehyde, heavy metals, and other toxic substances commonly found in conventionally produced textiles. Parents seeking organic options for their children can trust GOTS-certified garments to meet the highest safety and environmental standards. Our GOTS certification is annually verified by independent inspectors, ensuring ongoing compliance and documentation availability for brand verification.</p>
